ale":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910424011:1":{"text":"매일 이렇게 가둬 놓으면 멀쩡한 애도 미쳐 버리겠네.","source_cn":"天天被这么关着，就算没病都要被逼出疯病来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9334DFDEC6057620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910424012:1":{"text":"너와는 상관없는 일이니 쓸데없는 짓 하지 마라.","source_cn":"与你无关，别做多余的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EFB5ACC65CD51E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910424013:1":{"text":"...야! 하... 나 쟤랑 진짜 안 맞아.","source_cn":"……你！咱果然和你处不来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A0BAF709A25CDA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910424014:0":{"text":"卡律冷冷地看向图澜，图澜则毫不畏惧地回瞪过去，矛盾一触即发。歌尼特却突然开口，他努力向前探出身，摇晃着触手指向前方。","source_cn":"卡律冷冷地看向图澜，图澜则毫不畏惧地回瞪过去，矛盾一触...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC06D9281AA314815","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910424015:1":{"text":"那是什么？","source_cn":"那是什么？","status":"ambiguous_source_text","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910424016:1":{"text":"가네트... 톨란의 워터라이더를 보고 있어?","source_cn":"歌尼特……你是在说图澜的水行器？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF5D4802138C57A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910424017:1":{"text":"워터라이더? 저거... 멋있다.","source_cn":"水行器？看起来……很厉害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F2F5E878C62A3D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910424018:1":{"text":"쳇, 보는 눈은 있네. 덩치만 크고 머리에 든 거 없는 형보다 훨씬 낫잖아? 이건 내가 가장 아끼는 탈것이야. 직접 조립한 거라고!","source_cn":"啧，你的眼光还不错，比你这个只长个子不长脑子的哥哥强。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FD564880F45A063","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910424019:1":{"text":"...탈것? 그게 뭐야? 장난감이야?","source_cn":"坐骑……是什么？好看的玩具吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69E89AAC8834A78A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910424020:1":{"text":"우리 형도 만들 줄 알아. 형이 장난감 많이 만들어 줬어.","source_cn":"哥哥也会，哥哥给我做过很多玩具。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EC29FB16EC64B95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910424021:1